\pard\b\fs20 Mountain of Ashes\b0\par
\fs16\par
After most of the gold treasures had been mined, the last daring Clonks ventured high up into the ash mountains to mine gold there. The mountains lie in a volcanic range and are constantly threatened by volcanoes, ash and rocks. Many Clonks have already died in the attempt, but some made it up into the ash mountains with a blimp, whose engine the ash then destroyed.\par
\par
The goal of the round is to mine the entire gold deposit. Buildings need power and building materials.\par
